# `@knowvah/theme` (the docs site's brand theme) is published to GitHub
# Packages only, and a scope can point at one registry, so every @knowvah
# package installs from there. package.json's `publishConfig` keeps
# `npm publish` of this package itself pointed at npmjs. Auth for
# npm.pkg.github.com comes from ~/.npmrc locally and from the workflow token
# in CI; never here.
@knowvah:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
